/* Bidirectional capture, honest failure states, and the finite beta allowance. */
"开始广播后，切到目标应用上下滑动" = "Start the broadcast, switch apps, then scroll up or down.";
"返回目标应用上下滑动，前后画面保留重叠。结束时点按系统捕捉指示，或在这里停止。" = "Return to your app and scroll up or down, leaving overlap between views. When you are done, tap the system capture indicator or stop here.";
"切到目标应用，上下自然滑动" = "Switch apps and scroll up or down";
"先让希望保留的画面稳定，再向上或向下滑动，也可以回看已经经过的内容。保持竖屏，让前后画面有重叠；等图片加载完成后再继续。" = "Let the view you want to keep settle, then scroll up or down. You can revisit content you have already passed. Keep your iPhone in portrait and leave overlap between views. Wait for images to load before continuing.";
"未完成的捕捉" = "Unfinished captures";
"这些捕捉没有保存可用画面，点开可查看原因和重试建议。" = "No usable frames were saved for these captures. Open one to see what happened and how to try again.";
"未捕捉到可用画面" = "No usable frames captured";
"仅保留单屏" = "Single screen saved";
"这次捕捉在保存画面前结束。请重新开始，切到目标应用后稍作停留，再上下滑动。" = "Capture ended before any frames were saved. Start again, pause briefly in the app you want to capture, then scroll up or down.";
"捕捉意外中断，未保存可用画面。请重新开始捕捉。" = "Capture was interrupted before any usable frames were saved. Please start again.";
"捕捉已暂停，未保存可用画面。请重新开始捕捉。" = "Capture was paused before any usable frames were saved. Please start again.";
"屏幕方向改变，未保存可用画面。请保持竖屏并重新开始捕捉。" = "The screen rotated before any usable frames were saved. Keep your iPhone in portrait and start again.";
"画面尺寸发生变化，未保存可用画面。请重新开始捕捉。" = "The screen size changed before any usable frames were saved. Please start again.";
"画面无法可靠衔接，未保存可用画面。请让前后画面保留重叠，或调整捕捉区域后重试。" = "The frames could not be matched reliably, and no usable frames were saved. Leave overlap between views or adjust the capture area, then try again.";
"未检测到可衔接的滚动，未保存可用画面。请在目标应用稍作停留，再上下滑动后结束捕捉。" = "No matching scroll or usable saved frames were found. Pause briefly in the app you want to capture, then scroll up or down before stopping.";
"返回首页" = "Return home";
"暂时无法打开画面" = "Could not open the image";
"剩余 %lld / %lld" = "%lld of %lld remaining";
"本周免费导出" = "Free exports this week";
"测试版每周可免费导出 %lld 个新作品，每周一按设备本地时间更新额度。同一作品重复保存或分享始终只计一次，取消或失败不扣次数。历史记录保存在本机，正常升级不会清空本周已用次数。" = "Export %lld new works for free each week during the beta. Your allowance renews on Monday in your device’s time zone. Saving or sharing the same work again always counts only once; canceled or failed attempts do not count. Records stay on this device, and app updates keep your current weekly usage.";
"本周免费额度已用完，下周一恢复。已导出的作品仍可重复保存和分享；捕捉、查看和编辑不受影响。" = "This week’s free allowance has been used. It renews next Monday. You can still save and share previously exported works, and continue capturing, viewing, and editing.";
"已有购买的恢复与验证由 Apple 处理，续页不收集付款资料。每周额度和成功导出记录保存在本机，正常升级会保留。" = "Apple handles restoring and verifying existing purchases. Longlet does not collect payment details. Your weekly allowance and successful export records stay on this device and are kept when you update the app.";
"正在确认滚动区域，请缓慢滚动并等待画面稳定。" = "Confirming the scrolling area. Scroll gently and let the view settle.";
"画面暂时无法连续衔接，已保存已确认的连续长图。请降低滑动速度后重试。" = "The views could not be joined continuously. The confirmed continuous screenshot has been saved. Try again with slower scrolling.";
"未写入可用画面。请重新开始捕捉，进入目标页面后缓慢滚动。" = "No usable frames were written. Start a new capture, switch to the page you want, then scroll gently.";
"未确认连续滚动，仅保留一张完整单屏。请查看后重新捕捉长图。" = "Continuous scrolling was not confirmed. One complete screen has been saved. Review it, then try capturing a long screenshot again.";
"捕捉意外中断，未写入可用画面。请重新开始。" = "Capture was interrupted before any usable frames were written. Please start again.";
"自动衔接已保留首尾完整画面，顶部和底部可继续裁剪。" = "Automatic joining kept the complete first and last views. You can crop the top and bottom further.";
"顶部和底部均为 0% 时，会自动确认滚动区域，并保留首尾完整画面，完成后可继续裁剪。任一区域设为非零后，使用手动范围；手动忽略的内容不会被保存。" = "With both areas at 0%, the scrolling area is detected automatically and the complete first and last views are kept. You can crop them afterward. Set either area above zero to use manual bounds; manually excluded content is not saved.";
"本次没有可编辑或导出的图片，也未扣除导出次数。请先查看上方结束原因，再返回首页重新捕捉。" = "There is no image to edit or export, and no export allowance was used. Review the reason above, then return home to start a new capture.";
